# A `repeat forever` with no `exit repeat` never falls through, so a typed
# function needs no return after it.
function first_big takes list of number xs returns number is
    variable i is 1
    repeat forever
        if item i of xs is greater than 10
            return item i of xs
        end if
        add 1 to i
    end repeat
end function
constant r is the result of first_big list of 1, 50, 3
say r
